        {
          "key": "section.index.json.curated_product_grid_main.footer_body:3iyweh6tlv19p",
          "value": "<p>Leder du efter <a href=\"/collections/matching-family-vacation-outfits\">matchende ferietøj til familien</a> eller <a href=\"/collections/family-swimsuits\">matchende badetøj</a>? Start med familiesæt og badetøj, der samler familien i de samme farver.</p><p>Shopper du efter <a href=\"/collections/pajamas\">pyjamas til mor og barn</a>, <a href=\"/collections/new-women-outfits\">matchende familietøj</a>, <a href=\"/collections/formal-dresses\">kjoler til mor og datter som bryllupsgæster</a> eller <a href=\"/collections/daddy-me-shirts\">skjorter til far og barn</a>? Vælg først en kategori, og find derefter den kollektion, der passer til anledningen.</p>",
          "source": "<p>Planning a <a href=\"/collections/matching-family-vacation-outfits\">matching family vacation outfits</a> edit or a <a href=\"/collections/family-swimsuits\">matching beach swimsuits</a> collection? Start with coordinated family sets and swim looks that keep the whole group in one clear color story.</p><p>Shopping for <a href=\"/collections/pajamas\">mommy and me pajamas</a>, <a href=\"/collections/new-women-outfits\">family matching outfits</a>, <a href=\"/collections/formal-dresses\">mother daughter wedding guest dresses</a>, or <a href=\"/collections/daddy-me-shirts\">daddy and me shirts</a>? Start with the category first, then narrow into the collection that fits the moment.</p>",
          "sourceDigest": "421e7d8ef6d63f589373902205eb9b3523c0cf2899e901e3fb6cdaec645bc7ab",
          "before": null
